      "Mounted local code into containers to enable sub-second hot reload without image rebuilds.",
      "Switched default model to Gemma 4:e4b on Ollama with Metal GPU acceleration.",
      "Allocated ports 8001 and 5174 to prevent collisions with NewsLens AI containers.",
      "Persisted ChromaDB vector storage in the host data directory across runs."
